}{\plain \fs24 \f1 absolve all sinners who truly repent and believe in him, of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 his great mercy forgive you all your offenses; and by his\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 authority committed to me, I absolve you from all your sins:\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 In the Name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 Spirit.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Amen.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \i\f1  \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 or this}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \i\f1  }{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24
