}{\plain \fs24 \f1 for us to the Father, and who conferred power on his Church\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 to forgive sins, absolve you through my ministry by the grace\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 of the Holy Spirit, and restore you in the perfect peace of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 the Church.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Amen. \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 The Priest adds}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f1 The Lord has put away all your sins.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
